I agree wholeheartedly with what Robin says below.

Except that if the vote fails I will not be flaming anyone.  I will hovever=
 be abandoning Lojban as unworthy of any more of my time.=20=20

I have been slogging my guts out for six months trying to learn Lojban and =
I see no point in continuing if there is no interest in creating a stable e=
nvironment for learning the language.  This means not only a stable languag=
e design but also a community of users adhering to the same basic design.  =
If the vote fails I don't see how we are ever going to achieve this.  The a=
nalogy of Esperanto is an apt one.  Look at how well the Fundamento has ser=
ved Esperanto.  Then look at Ido.

Paul Dennett

