As the people who have been voting yes to the new policy proposal (and I
assure you, people *have* been voting yes) have largely been silent, let
me speak up:

I think that this policy proposal embodies an attitude and evinces a
style of action that ameliorates the vast majority of my previous
concerns about the leadershiplessness of the LLG.

I think the board should be lauded for putting it together.

-Robin

PS: And if the vote fails, I will personally post flames, directed at
the entire community, the likes of which you have never imagined.

